# Document upload size

All **document** uploads (National ID, KRA, beneficiary ID, claim evidence, admin KB files) must use the shared smallest limit:

- Frontend: `MAX_DOCUMENT_BYTES` from `frontend/src/lib/uploadLimits.ts` (5MB)
- Edge: `MAX_DOCUMENT_BYTES` from `supabase/functions/shared/upload-limits.ts` (5MB)

Do not raise this cap. Do not hardcode `10 * 1024 * 1024` or `20 * 1024 * 1024` on document paths.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
if (file.size > 10 * 1024 * 1024) { ... }

// ✅ GOOD
import { isDocumentTooLarge, documentTooLargeMessage } from '../../lib/uploadLimits'
if (isDocumentTooLarge(file.size)) {
  setError(documentTooLargeMessage('PDF'))
}
```

Existing files larger than 5MB stay readable. Only **new** uploads are rejected.

Leave the media library (video) and profile avatars on their own limits. Do not change M-Pesa.
